# Mapbox setup for the Live Tracking screen (src/app/(tabs)/(home)/live-tracking.tsx)
#
# You need a Mapbox account (https://account.mapbox.com) with two DIFFERENT tokens:
#
# 1. MAPBOX_DOWNLOADS_TOKEN — a SECRET token (scope: "Downloads:Read") used only at
#    BUILD TIME to download the native Mapbox SDK from their private registry.
#    Never ship this in the app. For local prebuilds it must also be configured in
#    ~/.netrc (see https://github.com/rnmapbox/maps/blob/main/getting-started.md).
#    For EAS builds, set it as a secret instead:
#      eas secret:create --scope project --name MAPBOX_DOWNLOADS_TOKEN --value <token> --type string
MAPBOX_DOWNLOADS_TOKEN=

# 2. EXPO_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN — your PUBLIC token (starts with "pk."), safe to ship
#    in the app bundle. Used at runtime to render the map itself.
EXPO_PUBLIC_MAPBOX_TOKEN=

# After setting both, you must rebuild the native project — this can't be picked up
# by Expo Go, and Metro/JS reload alone won't apply a new Mapbox plugin config:
#   npx expo prebuild --clean
#   eas build --profile development --platform ios   (or: npx expo run:ios)
